.gstack/

# Credentials — team-wide, and the one thing here that must stay shared.
# Personal tooling config belongs in each clone's .git/info/exclude; this does
# not, because a leaked secret is everyone's problem.
#
# Relevant to Lane 1 specifically: §3.5 gives every robot its own SQL user, and
# `cockroach cert` writes node and client certs into certs/.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
certs/
